UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Sheet Metal, a family-owned metal fabrication company, was founded in 2006 in Phoenix, Arizona. The business operates manufacturing facilities in both Phoenix and Tucson, serving the Arizona market with precision-fabricated sheet metal components for roofing systems.

The company specializes in standing seam metal roofing panels, custom flashing, coping, trim, soffit systems, and a full range of roofing accessories. Every item is made to specification with flexible options for profiles, colors, gauges, and finishes. Fabrication is performed in-house at its two Arizona plants, though the company does not disclose headcount or annual volume.

Advanced Sheet Metal supplies residential and commercial roofing contractors and builders across Arizona.

