UPDATE companies SET description='Advanced Technology of Kentucky, now operating as ATI Medical Supplies, was founded in 1990 in Florence, Kentucky. The company began as Advanced Technologies before adopting its current name, focusing on supplying durable medical equipment and clinical supplies to healthcare providers across the region.

The firm distributes a broad range of DME products including orthopedic bracing for neck, spine, shoulder, arm, wrist, hip, knee, foot, and ankle; cold therapy and continuous passive motion devices; bone stimulation and splinting systems; mobility aids such as crutches, walkers, canes, and bathroom safety equipment; lymphedema pumps and sleeves; respiratory devices including CPAP, nebulizers, and pulse oximeters; electrotherapy units for pain management; and hospital beds, wheelchairs, and incontinence supplies. In addition to product distribution, ATI operates an outside billing service that handles insurance claims for manufacturers and sales representatives bringing new products to market.

Customers include hospitals, surgery centers, urgent care clinics, orthopedic and primary care physician offices, home health agencies, rehabilitation centers, and college and high school athletic clinics throughout Ohio and Kentucky. The billing service extends to manufacturers and marketing teams nationwide seeking reimbursement support for DME products.

The company states its mission is to provide the highest quality medical supplies so healthcare providers can quickly treat patients and improve quality of life. It aims to simplify the insurance process, offering direct payment options when coverage is unavailable, and maintains contracts covering 99 percent of plans in Ohio and Kentucky including Medicare, Medicaid, commercial insurers, and workers'' compensation, with additional Medicare and commercial contracts nationwide.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Durable medical equipment distribution", "Orthopedic bracing supply", "Mobility aids distribution", "Respiratory equipment supply", "Cold therapy equipment supply", "Electrotherapy device distribution", "Hospital bed and wheelchair distribution", "Medical billing services", "Insurance claims processing", "Patient intake and verification", "Manufacturer reimbursement support"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Durable medical equipment", "Orthopedics", "Respiratory care", "Home health", "Sports medicine", "Workers'' compensation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Contracts covering 99% of insurance plans in Ohio and Kentucky (Medicare, Medicaid, commercial, workers'' comp)", "Nationwide Medicare and commercial plan coverage", "Dedicated intake specialists with monthly reporting", "Outside billing services for manufacturers and sales representatives", "Direct payment option for patients without insurance coverage"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1990 -> /", "Located in Florence, Kentucky -> db", "Now known as ATI Medical Supplies -> /", "Distributes orthopedic bracing, mobility aids, cold therapy, respiratory aids, electrotherapy, hospital beds, wheelchairs, incontinence supplies -> /", "Serves hospitals, surgery centers, urgent cares, physician offices, home health agencies, schools, rehab centers, community clinics -> /", "Offers outside billing services for manufacturers and sales representatives -> /", "Contracts cover 99% of plans in OH & KY (Medicare, Medicaid, commercial, workers'' comp) -> /", "Medicare and commercial plans nationwide -> /", "Dedicated intake specialists, monthly reporting -> /", "Mission: provide highest quality medical supplies for quick patient treatment -> /", "Goal: facilitate insurance process or offer direct payment -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Our Aim is to bring the best manufacturers of durable medical equipment and clinical supplies to medical professionals and their patients.", "founded_year": "1990", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='advanced-technology-of-kentucky' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Affordable Conveyor Services LLC is based in Southington, Connecticut. Founded in 2006, the company is owned and managed by Philip J. Robotham Jr., who brings over 30 years of experience in conveyor installation, repair, and maintenance. The business was built on a combined 60 years of industry experience among its team.

The firm provides end-to-end conveyor system services nationwide, including installation, preventive maintenance, emergency and routine repairs, safety inspections, system audits, replacements, upgrades, relocations, and alterations. It also services specialty equipment such as vertical reciprocating conveyors, stretch-wrap and band-strapping machines, mezzanines, racking, cranes, hoists, monorails, baggage handling systems, and pharmaceutical- and food-grade conveyors. Additional capabilities encompass site supervision, project management, controls and electrical repairs, pneumatic piping, and system modifications.

Its customers span distribution centers, retail fulfillment and warehousing operations, packaging and shipping centers, pharmaceutical manufacturing plants, airports and baggage handling facilities, and food and beverage processing facilities.

The company emphasizes competitiveness and attention to quality workmanship that exceeds customer expectations, with a focus on cost-effective solutions and immediate service availability.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Complete conveyor installation", "Preventative maintenance programs", "Emergency and routine repairs", "Safety inspections", "Maintenance inspections and system audits", "Replacement and upgrades", "Removal, relocation, and alterations", "Vertical reciprocating conveyor (VRC) installation, maintenance, and repair", "Stretch-wrap machine installation, maintenance, and repair", "Band-strapping machine installation, maintenance, and repair", "Mezzanine, racking, and shelving installation, maintenance, and repair", "Crane, hoist, and monorail installation, maintenance, and repair", "Baggage handling system installation, maintenance, and repair", "Parcel and package conveyor installation, maintenance, and repair", "Pharmaceutical and food grade conveyor installation, maintenance, and repair", "Garment conveyor installation, maintenance, and repair", "Unit handling system installation, maintenance, and repair", "Site supervision", "Project management", "Technical support and troubleshooting", "Controls and electrical repairs", "Pneumatic and air piping services", "System modifications", "Continued training"], "industries": ["Distribution Centers", "Retail Fulfillment and Warehousing", "Packaging and Shipping Centers", "Pharmaceutical Manufacturing", "Airports and Baggage Handling Facilities", "Food and Beverage Processing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Vertical reciprocating conveyors (VRCs)", "Stretch-wrap machines", "Band-strapping machines", "Mezzanines, racking and shelving", "Crane, hoist, and monorail", "Baggage handling systems", "Parcel and package conveyors", "Pharmaceutical and food grade conveyors", "Garment conveyors", "Unit handling systems"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/