UPDATE companies SET description='Alan Wire Company operates from Sikeston, Missouri, where it was founded over 50 years ago by Alan Keenan. The business began in the family garage and remains family-owned, with Keenan''s sons Scott and Jonathan now serving in leadership roles. The company''s Midwestern location puts it within a day''s drive of more than 60 percent of the U.S. population.

