UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Ladson, South Carolina, Alpha Sheet Metal Works has been serving the industrial community for over 80 years. The company is led by President Joseph W. Schady and operates as both a job shop and a contract manufacturer for prototype to medium-volume production.

