The company emphasizes fast turnaround on prototypes, molds, and production runs, with a focus on first-time quality and ISO 9000:2015 certification. Ambix differentiates itself through process optimization, failure analysis, automation integration, and a strong vendor network that enables domestic manufacturing and cost reduction.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','ISO 9000:2015','ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic injection molding", "Mold design", "Prototyping", "Contract manufacturing", "Material selection", "Process design", "High-temperature molding", "Precision machining", "Small parts packaging", "Sorting and bagging", "Automation integration", "Failure analysis", "Process optimization", "Supply chain management", "Vendor management"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "100 parts to millions", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fast turnaround on prototypes, molds, and production", "First-time quality commitment with ISO 9000:2015 certification", "On-shoring expertise that lowers costs and improves yields through process optimization and failure analysis", "Automation implementation and vendor network for raw material security", "Small-parts packing, sorting, and bagging services"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2001 -> db", "Headquarters Albany, New Hampshire -> db", "Certifications ISO9001, ITAR -> db", "Capabilities: plastic injection molding, mold design, prototyping, contract manufacturing, high-temperature molding, precision machining, small parts packaging -> db, /", "Volume range 100 parts to millions -> /about-us", "Differentiators: fast turnaround, first-time quality, on-shoring, process optimization, failure analysis, automation, vendor network -> /, /about-us", "Case studies: supply chain risk mitigation, budget-constrained product launch, demand surge with material constraints -> /, /about-us", "ISO 9000:2015 certification claim -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products":