UPDATE companies SET description='American Howa Kentucky, Inc. Georgetown Plant (AHK-GT) is located in Midway, Kentucky. The facility was established in 2017 as part of the North American expansion of HOWA USA Holdings, Inc., which traces its U.S. presence to a 2004 plant in Indiana.

The plant produces automotive interior components, including headliners, sunshades, dash insulators, felt products, and polyurethane foam parts. Production capabilities include felt manufacturing, PU foam processing (with two foam lines), and on-site headliner assembly. The facility supports programs for multiple automakers, though specific facility size, headcount, and annual volumes are not disclosed.

The Georgetown plant serves the automotive industry, supplying Tier 1 and OEM customers. Its client list includes Nissan North America (for the Leaf, Murano, Titan, and Frontier), Toyota Motor North America, American Honda Motor Co., Aisin World Corp. of America, and Webasto Product North America.

The company''s stated mission emphasizes employee well-being, unique product development through boldness and creativity, environmental conservation, continuous improvement for customer satisfaction, and contribution to local development. The Georgetown plant was added to expand capacity for PU foam and headliner production in support of growing North American demand.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sunshade production", "Dash insulator production", "Felt production", "PU foam production", "Headliner production", "Interior trim manufacturing", "On-site headliner assembly"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Automotive interior"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["PU foam production line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["On-site headliner production at customer assembly plants (first in HOWA North America history)", "Two dedicated PU foam production lines", "Global network of 33 manufacturing and R&D facilities"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Midway, KY -> db", "Founding year: 2017 -> /about", "Parent company: HOWA USA Holdings, Inc. -> /about", "Global facilities: 33 manufacturing and R&D sites -> /", "Products: headliners, sunshades, dash insulators, felt, PU foam parts -> /about", "Processes: felt production, PU foam production, headliner production -> /about", "Clients: Nissan North America, Toyota Motor North America, American Honda Motor Co., Aisin World Corp. of America, Webasto Product North America -> /about", "Mission statements -> /about", "On-site headliner production at Nissan Canton and Cuernavaca -> /about", "Second PU foam production line added in 2017 -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "With 33 manufacturing and R&D facilities in over a dozen countries worldwide", "founded_year": "2017", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_a