UPDATE companies SET description='American Precision Products was founded in 1972 in Huntsville, Alabama. The company operates as a custom injection molding firm serving commercial, aerospace, and government markets.

The company molds thermoplastics, thermoplastic elastomers, and thermoset materials, including filled and modified resins. Its processes encompass custom injection molding, compression molding, transfer molding, insert molding, overmolding, and miniature and micro molding. Additional services include prototyping, in-house mold building and tooling, and overseas tooling sourcing. Production runs range from low volume to high volume, with micro molding capabilities on dedicated high-speed presses since 1987.

American Precision Products serves military, aerospace, and commercial industries. The firm emphasizes highly controlled manufacturing specifications—tolerances, cosmetics, and production control measures—tailored for aerospace and military applications.

The company positions its injection molding as faster, more accurate, and more repeatable than traditional compression and transfer molding, offering a path to cost savings and quality improvements for existing programs. Its differentiators include micro molding expertise since 1987, in-house tooling, and the ability to manage both short and long production runs.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Injection Molding", "Compression Molding", "Transfer Molding", "Miniature and Micro Molding", "Insert Molding", "Overmolding", "Prototyping", "In-House Mold Building/Tooling", "Overseas Tooling", "Molding of Thermoplastics", "Molding of Thermoplastic Elastomers", "Molding of Thermosets", "Molding of Filled and Modified Resins", "Molding of Engineering Resins", "Molding of Elastomer Resins"], "industries": ["Military", "Aerospace", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Thermoplastics", "Thermoplastic elastomers", "Thermosets", "Engineering resins", "Elastomer resins", "Filled and modified resins"], "equipment": ["High-speed/high-pressure presses for micro molding"], "volume": "Low volume to high volume production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Highly controlled manufacturing specifications for aerospace and military applications", "Micro molding capability since 1987", "In-house mold building and tooling", "Overseas tooling sourcing", "Short and long production runs"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1972 -> db", "Headquarters Huntsville, Alabama -> db", "Custom injection molding firm -> /", "Molds thermoplastics, thermoplastic elastomers, thermosets -> /", "Processes: injection, compression, transfer, insert, overmolding, micro molding -> /", "In-house mold building and tooling -> /", "Overseas tooling -> /", "Micro molding since 1987 -> capabilities list", "Industries: Military, Aerospace, Commercial -> industries_served", "Highly controlled specs for aerospace/military -> /", "Injection molding faster, more accurate, more repeat