UPDATE companies SET description='American Sewing Workroom, LLC operates as a family-owned business in Roswell, Georgia, within the metro Atlanta area. The company serves as a one-stop shop for established clothing lines and newcomers to the garment industry, offering services from concept through pattern making, grading, prototyping, cutting, sewing, and embroidery.

The workroom handles each phase of production with skilled technicians and product development specialists. Its CEO is a professional tailor with extensive fashion industry experience, capable of creating patterns from initial ideas.

