The company differentiates itself through attention to detail described as unparalleled in the industry, with a focus on quality and reliable service across every step of production development.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Pattern making", "Grading", "Prototyping", "Cutting and sewing", "Embroidery", "Product development"], "industries": ["Women''s fashion", "Children''s fashion", "Apparel manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated in Roswell, GA", "One-stop shop from concept to finished garment", "Domestic manufacturing in the USA", "Skilled technicians and product development specialists", "CEO with professional tailoring and design expertise"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned business in Roswell, Georgia -> /", "One-stop shop from concept to pattern making, grading, prototypes, cutting, sewing, embroidery -> /", "Produces clothing lines for women''s and children''s fashion designers -> /", "CEO is a professional tailor with extensive fashion industry experience -> /", "Proud of making products in the U.S. -> /", "Skilled technicians and product development specialists -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "ASW produces clothing lines for clients who are women and children''s fashion designers both local and/or out of state.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='american-sewing-workroom' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='American Sheet Metal Fabricators, Inc. (ASM) operates a Union Local 73 fabrication shop in South Holland, Illinois, on Chicago’s south side. The business is led by members of the DeBartolo family: Dennis DeBartolo serves as president, Frank DeBartolo as vice president, Anthony DeBartolo as superintendent, and Christine DeBartolo as treasurer. The company does not disclose its founding year.

ASM produces HVAC ductwork and fittings in a variety of configurations. Its capabilities include lockforming rectangular straight duct and fittings, snaplock and Pittsburgh lock fabrication, welded construction of rectangular and round duct (with TIG welding available), double-wall rectangular and spiral duct with solid or perforated inner liners, and spiral pipe from 4 to 40 inches in diameter. The shop also installs acoustical liner (Armaflex, Armacell), fabricates roof caps, custom drain pans, roof curbs, platform curbs, and roof rails, and supplies accessories such as canvas, Ductmate frames, TDF hardware, sealers, and screws. Additional services include end wrapping, custom register and linear boxes, painted pipe chase covers, painted duct, pre-assembled duct runs with collars and taps installed, and cut-to-size cleats and drives. All work is fabricated to SMACNA standards.

The company serves mechanical and HVAC contractors, with testimonials referencing customers such as EMCOR Team. Its product line covers commercial and residential applications, including roof-top units, residential plenums, and return-air elbows available for same-day pick-up.

ASM emphasizes a customer-driven approach, offering high-quality products at reasonable prices. Differentiators include a large inventory of low-pressure snaplock pipe and fittings, same-day pick-up for select items, and pre-assembled duct runs delivered sealed and ready to install.', certifications=ARRAY['SMACNA standards']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Lockforming rectangular straight duct and fittings", "Snaplock fabrication", "Pittsburgh lock fabrication", "Welded construction of rectangular and round duct", "TIG welding", "Double-wall rectangular duct fabrication (solid or perforated inner shell)", "Double-wall spiral pipe fabrication (solid or perforated inner shell)", "Spiral pipe and fittings (4\u201340 in. diameter)", "Acoustical liner installation (Armaflex, Armacell)", "Low-pressure snaplock pipe and fittings", "Roof caps (permanent and temporary)", "Custom drain pans", "Roof curbs, platform curbs, roof rails", "Accessories (canvas, Ductmate frames, TDF hardware, sealers, screws)", "End wrapping for dust/debris protection", "Custom register and linear boxes", "Painted pipe chase covers", "Painted duct and fittings", "Pre-assembled duct runs with collars/taps installed", "Cut-to-size cleats and drives (S cleat, drive, bar cleat)", "Roof-top units, residential plenums, return-air elbows", "SMACNA standards compliance"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Galvanized steel", "Paint Grip steel", "PVC-coated steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Black iron (1/4 in., 10\u201316 ga.)", "Armaflex", "Armacell", "Gripple material", "Canvas", "Ductmate frames", "TDF hardware", "Sealers", "Screws"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day pick-up available for select HVAC components (roof-top units, residential plenums, duct, return-air elbows)", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Union Local 73 fabrication shop", "Fabricated to SMACNA standards", "Same-day pick-up for roof-top units, plenums, duct, and return-air elbows", "Pre-assembled duct runs de