UPDATE companies SET description='American Wood Design, Inc. is a family-owned commercial cabinetry and architectural millwork shop based in Chester, Pennsylvania. The company was founded in 1996 by Michael Gilhool Sr., who launched the business above a doctor''s office in South Philadelphia after his previous employer closed its display shop. Gilhool bartered the shop''s machinery for cabinetry work, and the operation later spent nearly two decades at Naamans Road Business Park before moving to a 16,000-square-foot facility in Chester in 2017.

The shop produces custom cabinets, countertops, reception desks, nurse stations, and a full range of architectural millwork including office front systems, wall paneling, and custom trim. Its equipment includes a computerized beam saw, CNC router, and edgebander driven by dedicated software, allowing both high-volume production runs and the flexibility to handle small projects. Services also cover plastic laminate layups with a 3–5 day turnaround, solid surface and stone countertop fabrication, and ongoing maintenance and repair work.

The founding mission — to build cabinetry and relationships that last a lifetime — emphasizes on-time, on-budget craftsmanship. Gilhool''s original impetus was turning a layoff into an opportunity, and the business continues to stress quick turnaround, competitive pricing on wholesale press jobs, and a willingness to handle service calls and modifications long after installation.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic laminate layups", "CNC routing", "Beam saw cutting", "Edgebanding", "Solid surface fabrication", "Granite/marble/quartz countertop fabrication", "Custom millwork (trims, mouldings, wood base)", "Architectural millwork (office front systems, wall paneling)", "Reception desk fabrication", "Nurse station fabrication", "Cabinet and countertop fabrication", "Plastic laminate repairs", "Modification work", "Maintenance/service calls"], "industries": ["Commercial cabinetry", "Architectural millwork", "Healthcare", "Office fit-outs"], "materials": ["Plastic laminate", "Solid surface", "Granite", "Marble", "Quartz", "Wood"], "equipment": ["Computerized beam saw", "CNC router", "Edgebander", "Machinery control software"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "3\u20135 days from material procurement for plastic laminate layups; fast leadtimes emphasized", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned since 1996", "16,000 sq ft facility with CNC router, beam saw, and edgebander", "Fast turnaround: 3\u20135 days for plastic laminate layups", "100 linear foot minimum for custom millwork", "Servicing, maintenance, and repair services offered"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1996 by Michael Gilhool Sr. -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about, /", "Located in Chester, PA -> /about, /", "Moved to Chester in 2017, expanded from 5,000 to 16,000 sq ft -> /about", "Equipment: computerized beam saw, CNC router, edgebander -> /about", "Services: plastic laminate layups, cabinets, countertops, reception desks, nurse stations, architectural millwork, custom millwork, 