UPDATE companies SET description='Anderson Electric Co. is a family-owned electrical contracting firm based in Aberdeen, South Dakota. Founded in 2020 by Shaine Anderson, the company emerged after Anderson accumulated over a decade of experience in residential, commercial, and industrial electrical work, including a stint overseeing maintenance departments at a local beef processing plant. Anderson''s vision centered on building healthy customer relationships and strong workplace leadership, values he codified as integrity, quality, and service.

The company designs, installs, repairs, and maintains electrical systems across residential, commercial, farm, and industrial sectors. Its service portfolio includes industrial electrical maintenance, project design, controls and automation, custom lighting, and smart home technology integration. All installed equipment carries UL listing, and the firm adheres to National Electrical Code and local fire safety standards, often exceeding minimum requirements. Anderson Electric is licensed, insured, and bonded in South Dakota, with reciprocity in other states.

Customers range from homeowners seeking wiring upgrades or smart home installations to commercial operators needing industrial maintenance and automation. Notable projects include the transformation of a 1950s church into a café, involving full electrical modernization and kitchen outlet design, as well as residential service work such as bathroom fan ducting and outlet relocation. The firm also serves agricultural and industrial clients with equipment troubleshooting and 480V switchgear expertise.

Anderson Electric distinguishes itself through a commitment to "going the extra mile," emphasizing personal consultation, employee development, and community giving. A portion of monthly revenue supports organizations such as Destiny Rescue, Coffee with a Cause, and Aberdeen''s Safe Harbor. The company''s focus on vetting employees for safety and investing in leadership training reflects its founding principle that a healthy workforce yields better service.', certifications=ARRAY['UL Listed']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical system design", "Electrical installation", "Electrical repair", "Electrical maintenance", "Industrial electrical maintenance", "Industrial electrical project design", "Controls and automation", "Custom lighting projects", "Smart home technology integration", "Residential electrical", "Commercial electrical", "Farm electrical", "Industrial electrical", "480V switchgear systems", "Low voltage control systems", "Equipment troubleshooting"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Farm", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated", "UL-listed equipment on all installations", "Licensed, insured, and bonded in South Dakota", "Exceeds National Electrical Code minimums", "Monthly donations to child-focused charities"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2020 -> /about-us", "Family-owned -> /about-us, /", "Shaine Anderson founder -> /about-us", "Located in Aberdeen, South Dakota -> /", "Services: residential, commercial, farm, industrial electrical -> /", "Industrial electrical maintenance, project design, controls and automation, custom lighting, smart home technology -> /", "UL listed equipment -> /", "Licensed, insured, bonded in South Dakota -> /about-us", "Monthly charitable giving to Destiny Rescue, Coffee with a Cause, Safe Harbor -> /, /about-us", "Employee vetting and leadership training -> /about-us", "Shaine Anderson experience since 2005 -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Anderson Electric is a family-owned electrical contracting business, serving the needs of Aberdeen, SD and the surrounding area.", "founded_year": "2020", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='anderson-electric-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Andon Electronics Corporation is based in Lincoln, Rhode Island. The company is led by president John O. Tate, who developed the precision semiconductor socket contact that underpins its product line. While the founding year is not publicly disclosed, the business has established itself as a specialist in socket solutions for electronic device placement.

The company manufactures innovative precision sockets used to mount image sensors, optoelectronic sensors, gas sensors, DC‑DC converters, batteries, crystal oscillators, fuses, relays, and other electronic devices onto printed circuit boards. Its catalog spans dozens of package types — including PGA, BGA, LCC, DIP, SIP, TO, PLCC, and LED — as well as specialty items such as heat‑sink sockets, high‑temperature sockets, ultra‑low‑profile sockets, floating‑pin sockets, and laminate wafer sockets. Andon offers both standard and custom socket designs.

Andon’s sockets are used by original equipment manufacturers and contract manufacturers in industries such as camera production, laser manufacturing, gas‑sensing equipment, and broader electronic product assembly. Named customers include Chungwa Telecom Labs and Micropac Industries, indicating a presence in telecommunications and specialized industrial electronics.

The company states that its socket designs help customers avoid device damage during assembly, reduce board‑assembly labor, and improve turnaround time. This focus on device protection and assembly efficiency is presented as the core reason for its product development.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Precision semiconductor socket manufacturing", "Custom socket design", "Standard socket supply"], "industries": ["Camera manufacturing", "Laser manufacturing", "Gas sensing equipment manufacturing", "Electronic products manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Innovative precision socket designs for optimum device protection", "Sockets help avoid device damage during board assembly", "Solutions reduce board assembly labor", "Designs improve assembly turnaround time", "Offers both standard and custom socket configurations"], "facts_used": ["Location: Lincoln, Rhode Island -> db", "President: John O. Tate -> page /", "Product range: precision sockets for image sensors, optoelectronic sensors, gas sensors, DC-DC converters, batteries, crystal oscillators, fuses, relays -> page /", "Certification: ISO 9001 -> db", "Customers: Chungwa Telecom Labs, Micropac Industries -> db", "Industries: camera manufacturing, laser manufacturing, gas sensing equipment manufacturing, electronic products manufacturing -> page /", "Differentiators: avoid device damage, reduce board assembly labor, improve turnaround -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Andon Electronics makes innovative precision sockets used in the placement of image sensors, optoelectronic and gas sensors, DC-DC converters, batteries, crystal oscillators, fuses, relays, and other electronic devices onto PC boards.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_t